      "_updatedAt": "2026-10-12T12:48:31Z",
      "about": "Airtel Xsafe marks Airtel's significant entry into the smart home security landscape, offering a comprehensive suite of Wi-Fi-enabled surveillance and monitoring solutions. Crafted to instill profound peace of mind, Airtel Xsafe seamlessly integrates cutting-edge camera technology with intelligent features and secure cloud-based services, all effortlessly managed through a user-centric mobile application. Our core objective was to position Xsafe as a highly trusted, universally accessible, and indispensable home security solution within Airtel's expansive digital ecosystem.",
      "aboutVideoPath": "https://wugweb.online/assets/work/Airtel%20Xsafe/Xsafe_about.mp4",
      "aiKeywords": "Airtel Xsafe, Smart Home, IoT, Security, UX Design, Telecom",
      "aiSummary": "Airtel Xsafe is Airtel's smart home security offering of Wi-Fi cameras, intelligent features and cloud services managed through a mobile app. Launching it meant building trust in a new service and explaining complex technology simply. Wugweb, with Dentsu Webchutney, designed the website with visual product storytelling, simplified feature communication, privacy and support messaging, and a clearer purchase flow aligned with Airtel's design system. The case study reports better product understanding and more subscriptions and purchases.",
