      "about": "Airtel Xstream Play consolidates India's fragmented digital entertainment landscape, bringing a multitude of streaming partners under one seamless roof. Wugweb's pivotal role was to design a compelling Airtel Website page for the \"Xstream Entertainment Festival.\" This page was crucial for effectively communicating the platform's vast offerings, unique value propositions, and diverse access models to a broad audience, driving engagement and subscriptions within Airtel's extensive digital ecosystem.",
      "aboutVideoPath": "https://wugweb.online/assets/work/Airtel%20Xstream/Xstream_about.mp4",
      "aiKeywords": "Airtel Xstream Play, OTT, Streaming, Entertainment UX, Telecom",
      "aiSummary": "Airtel Xstream Play brings multiple streaming partners into one service. Wugweb, with Dentsu Webchutney, designed the Airtel web page for the Xstream Entertainment Festival, which had to explain aggregated content, prepaid-linked and location-based access, and a clear path to subscription. The page used upfront value messaging, transparent offer explanations, simplified access steps and layouts aligned with Airtel's design system, and served as a campaign acquisition touchpoint.",
